@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = {{loginDKM.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. Cek Koneksi Server & Database
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login Pengurus DKM (Otomatis simpan token ke @token)
# @name loginDKM
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pengurus@sambungjamaah.id",
  "password": "amanah123"
}

### 3. Read - Lihat Semua Jadwal Kegiatan
GET {{baseUrl}}/kegiatan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create - Tambah Jadwal Kegiatan (Khusus DKM)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kegiatan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "judul_kegiatan": "Musyawarah Persiapan Ramadhan",
  "kategori": "Musyawarah Pengurus DKM",
  "deskripsi": "Koordinasi jadwal kajian dan konsumsi buka bersama.",
  "tanggal": "2026-12-05",
  "waktu_mulai": "19:30",
  "waktu_selesai": "21:00",
  "tempat": "Aula Masjid Al-Falah"
}

### 5. Update - Edit Jadwal Kegiatan ID 1 (Khusus DKM)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/kegiatan/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "judul_kegiatan": "Pengajian Rutin Malam Ahad",
  "kategori": "Pengajian Rutin Umum",
  "deskripsi": "Pembahasan tafsir tematik dan tanya jawab jama'ah.",
  "tanggal": "2026-12-06",
  "waktu_mulai": "19:30",
  "waktu_selesai": "21:30",
  "tempat": "Ruang Utama Masjid"
}

### 6. Create - Isi Presensi Kehadiran
POST {{baseUrl}}/presensi
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "kegiatan_id": 1,
  "is_perwakilan": false,
  "status_kehadiran": "Hadir"
}

### 7. Read - Rekap Presensi Semua Jama'ah (Khusus DKM)
GET {{baseUrl}}/presensi/dkm/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}